'''Fireball Frenzy''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Ember}} that allows {{A|Fireball}} to, instead of charging, be held on cast, creating a wave of energy traveling outward from the user that temporarily grants the caster and nearby allies additional {{D|Heat}} damage to all attacks.
<section end=intro />
