==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''General''' under {{Faction|Steel Meridian}}, or the rank of '''Exalted''' under the {{Faction|Red Veil}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Damage bonus is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Duration is affected by [[Ability Duration]].
*Range is affected by [[Ability Range]].
*Adds {{D|Heat}} damage to weapons. This damage bonus does '''not''' combine with other elements, but '''does''' contribute to DoT, and is '''additive''' with elemental mods.
**Does <u>not</u> affect [[Exalted Weapon|Exalted Weapons]] or Warframe abilities.

*Multiple Fireball Frenzy do not stack; the buff with the highest Ability Strength will take effect.
**However if a weaker with more Ability Duration is cast, it will take effect after the stronger buff expires.

